# Local override — gitignored. Set DATABASE_URL or DB_* here only if you
# need to point tests at a non-default Postgres (e.g. a docker container
# with a password). For the common case — local Homebrew Postgres on a
# non-5432 port — just `export POSTGRESQL_PORT=...` (or rely on the
# root .envrc's default of 5433) and leave this file empty.
